---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Terms of Service - SnapImg</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Terms of Service for SnapImg online utilities." />
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased">

  <nav class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-black text-xl tracking-tight text-white">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-sm">⚡</span>
        Snap<span class="text-blue-500">Img</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-800/40">
        ← Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 flex-1 w-full space-y-6 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing and using SnapImg (snapimg.curiolot.com), you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable laws and regulations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Free & Client-Side Sandbox Usage</h2>
      <p>
        SnapImg provides client-side image utility tools free of charge. You retain 100% full ownership, rights, and copyright to any images processed through this tool. We do not access, inspect, or store any of your files.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The services are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind. SnapImg will not be held liable for any data loss, file degradation, or downtime.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
    <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 mb-3">
      <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-slate-300 transition">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-slate-300 transition">Terms of Service</a>
      <a href="https://curiolot.com" class="hover:text-slate-300 transition">Curiolot Network</a>
    </div>
    <p>© 2026 SnapImg. Part of the Curiolot Network.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>